# Seats and pairing (docs/guide/concepts-seats.md).
title: A seat is an agent twin, paired with a human when you want one
direction: down
seat: A seat, such as Product Strategist
twin: Agent twin: drafts, runs, files
human: Paired human: answers, reviews, approves
item: A work item that is complete and checked
seat -> twin: does the work
seat -> human: holds the gates
twin -> item
human -> item
